  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><p>The maximum temporary prims allowed are based on the regular prim limit:</p>
<p>`(regular_prim_limit - current_regular_prims) + minimum(0.5 * regular_prim_limit + 400, 1000)`</p>
<p>See this <a href="http://forums.secondlife.com/showthread.php?t=305651" target="_blank">forum post</a> and <a href="https://jira.secondlife.com/browse/SVC-2380" target="_blank">SVC-2380</a> for details.</p></li>
    <li>The garbage collection timer is cumulative and cannot be reset. You can turn TEMP_ON_REZ off which stops the timer running but it will continue from where it left off if TEMP_ON_REZ is restored.</li>
    <li><p>Meshes are different than ordinary Prims and Sculpts when set Temporary.</p>
<p>They still count against the Parcel and Sim Prim Limits. See: <a href="http://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Mesh_Prim_Equivalence_test#Temporary_meshes" target="_blank">http://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Mesh_Prim_Equivalence_test#Temporary_meshes</a></p></li>
  </ul>
